# Trivy vulnerability ignore list.
#
# Every entry below must carry: the CVE id, a one-line justification, an owner,
# and a review/expiry date. An entry past its expiry date should be treated as
# a build failure waiting to happen — re-run Trivy and either fix or renew it.
#
# CVE-2026-68525
# Justification: flagged in embedded Apache Tomcat, pulled in transitively via
# spring-boot-starter-webmvc off spring-boot-starter-parent 4.1.0. Could not
# verify a patched spring-boot-starter-parent version against Maven Central
# at the time this was triaged — the search index doesn't list any
# org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-parent release at or above
# 4.x, only up to 3.5.3, so there's no way to confirm which (if any) parent
# bump actually carries the fix without guessing. Accepted short-term rather
# than bump to an unverified version; re-triage before expiry with a real
# registry lookup.
# Owner: babitha.bollu@gmail.com
# Review-by: 2026-10-13

# CVE-2026-65905
# Justification: same root cause/blocker as CVE-2026-68525 above (embedded
# Tomcat via spring-boot-starter-parent 4.1.0; no verifiable patched parent
# version found on Maven Central at triage time).
# Owner: babitha.bollu@gmail.com
# Review-by: 2026-10-13

